  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Future of Citizenship by Investment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Harmonisation between Eastern Caribbean CBI countries results in a culture that aims for quality (high price over high volume to generate revenue, removing discounting and agents working on large commissions that do not flow to CBI countries) and increased sharing of knowledge (if an applicant is rejected by one programme then they are rejected for all programmes). Delivered through regional dialogue and coordination with likeminded international partners (i.e. USA, EU and Canada) aimed at promoting positive risk management and discouraging competitive undercutting of programmes.</narrative>
  </description>
